---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Portfolio | EPPPE.NET">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
		<section class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/75 p-8 shadow-[0_24px_80px_rgba(2,6,23,0.32)] sm:p-10">
			<p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-cyan-300">Index</p>
			<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Portfolio</h1>
			<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
				A concise index for technical work, course artifacts, and writing that needs more context than a home page can hold.
			</p>
		</section>

		<div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.5fr_0.85fr]">
			<section class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/65 p-6 sm:p-8">
				<h2 class="text-lg font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-400">Shelves</h2>
				<div class="mt-6 space-y-4">
					<section class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5">
						<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-400">Business</p>
						<div class="mt-3">
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Business Portfolio</h3>
							<p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
								Cloud, systems, and infrastructure work will live here as case studies instead of loose project blurbs.
							</p>
							<p class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400">Status: collecting project evidence</p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<a href="/portfolio/composition" class="group block rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5 transition-colors hover:border-cyan-300/40 hover:bg-cyan-300/5">
						<div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
							<div>
								<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-300">Composition</p>
								<h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-100">Composition Research Portfolio</h3>
							</div>
							<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-300">Open page</span>
						</div>
						<p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
							Cover letter, student learning outcome reflections, major writing assignments, drafts, activities, and evidence.
						</p>
						<p class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400">Status: structure ready for course artifacts</p>
					</a>
				</div>
			</section>

			<aside class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/65 p-6 sm:p-8">
				<h2 class="text-lg font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-400">What Lives Here</h2>
				<div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
					<p>
						The home page gives the short version. Portfolio pages carry the evidence, drafts, and context.
					</p>
					<p>
						The Vault remains separate: services, catalog entries, and personal archive material.
					</p>
				</div>
			</aside>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
